### 5. Competitor Analysis & Differentiation
* **Supplied Competitor URL:** [CaratLane Nayan Gold Kada for Men](https://www.caratlane.com/jewellery/nayan-gold-kada-for-men-ub00636-1y0000.html)
* **Intent Type:** E-commerce Product Display Page (PDP) for a single men's gold kada SKU (`UB00636-1Y0000`).
* **Competitive Gaps Identified & Solved:**
  1. *Core Architecture:* CaratLane lacks educational depth on solid vs semi-solid vs hollow construction. Our guide provides clear weight thresholds (25g+ for solid) and anti-denting physics.
  2. *Sizing Science:* Competitor provides standard size dropdowns without explaining the crucial knuckle-pass vs wrist-contour distinction. Our guide provides step-by-step tape measurement and standard Indian diameter conversions (2.6, 2.8, 2.10, 2.12).
  3. *Metallurgical Purity Guidance:* Explains why 18K (750) provides superior tensile strength and dent resistance for daily active wear compared to ductile 22K (916).
  4. *Tax and Invoice Transparency:* Complete breakdown of bullion weight, making charges, and statutory 3% GST calculation.
  5. *AEO / Search Parity:* 7 detailed visible FAQs answering high-volume conversational search queries absent on product pages.

